---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon'
---

<Layout
	title="Camino Network Foundation Update - December 13, 2024"
	description='In this update, we will provide an overview of where the network stands today and what lies ahead. Our achievements over the past year set the stage for even greater progress in the coming months, as we and the community continue to build a robust global ecosystem.'
>
    <div class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-caminoSky/30">
        <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-8 text-center">
            <div class="inline-block tracking-tight mb-6 text-transparent uppercase font-medium bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary">
                December 13, 2024
            </div>
            <div class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight">
                Camino Network <br> Foundation Update
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose max-w-screen-md mx-auto px-8 py-16 prose-headings:font-light prose-h2:font-normal prose-h3:flex prose-a:text-gray-500 prose-a:font-normal prose-strong:font-normal">

        <h3>Full Update</h3>
        <p>At the Camino Network Foundation, we remain committed to transparency and sustainable growth. In this update, we’ll provide an overview of where the network stands today and what lies ahead. Our achievements over the past year set the stage for even greater progress in the coming months, as we and the community continue to build a robust global ecosystem. </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Camino Milestones: Building a Global Ecosystem</h2>

        <h3><Icon name="tabler:cpu" class="w-8 mr-2 text-primary" /> Technological Advancements</h3>
        <p><strong>Network Transactions and Wallet Addresses:</strong> 20 months after the launch of the Camino Mainnet, the network surpassed 315,000+ transactions in December, a significant achievement before the CAM listing. Additionally, the ecosystem counts over 45,000 wallet addresses, highlighting the increasing adoption and engagement across the network.</p>
        <p><strong>Camino Messenger Success:</strong> The Camino Messenger alpha is live on the mainnet, enabling seamless B2B data exchange for global travel product distribution. With 14 message types for the standardization of travel products, it continues to expand its capabilities. By standardizing the way of exchanging information, like bookings and payments, companies worldwide can reduce integration and operational costs. Notably, the Lufthansa Group and several other major companies are looking at the Messenger as a new distribution channel.</p>

        <h3><Icon name="tabler:leaf" class="w-8 mr-2 text-primary" /> Community and Ecosystem Growth</h3>
        <p><strong>Engaged Builders and Validators:</strong> The network boasts over 50 active builders from leading brands such as MTS, Lufthansa or Finmont, creating cutting-edge B2B and B2C travel products. The validator community has grown to 100+ validators (60% online) and 200+ supporters, reflecting increasing decentralization and network robustness.</p>
        <p><strong>Hackathons and Grant Programs:</strong> Central to our strategy, in-person events, conferences, and hackathons continue to drive collaboration and accelerate innovation. This year, Camino partners hosted three successful hackathons and one business-focused community event, yielding impressive results—new builders, innovative applications, and out-of-the-box ideas for the travel industry. Supported by grants and mentoring, these initiatives have significantly contributed to the tangible growth of the Camino ecosystem.</p>

        <h3><Icon name="tabler:thumb-up" class="w-8 mr-2 text-primary" /> Strategic Partnerships</h3>
        <p><strong>Monerium Integration:</strong> The partnership with Monerium introduces regulated Euro stablecoins to Camino Network, unlocking new business use cases by bringing payment on-chain.</p>
        <p><strong>Fireblocks Integration:</strong> Fireblocks integrated Camino in September, enabling secure digital asset management and access to over 2,000 institutional liquidity partners. This enterprise-grade infrastructure enhances the security, efficiency, and scalability of travel transactions.</p>
        <p><strong>Outlier Ventures Partnership:</strong> Selected for Outlier Ventures' Ascent program, Camino Network is strategically positioned to strengthen the CAM token's market presence and expand its reach within the web3 space.</p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Outlook 2025</h2>

        <p>In 2025, we anticipate a significant leap forward in adoption. Our current focus is on:</p>

        <p><strong>Scaling Industry Adoption:</strong> Engaging more companies and travelers, demonstrating the real-world impact of blockchain in travel. The Camino Messenger is set to lead this charge as a flagship dApp, addressing the critical connectivity challenges in travel and accelerating adoption across the ecosystem.</p>

        <p><strong>Supporting the launch of new dApps and Use Cases:</strong> Supporting builders delivering innovative solutions built on Camino to address specific industry pain points.</p>

        <p><strong>Expanding Partnerships:</strong> Collaborating with global players to bridge the gap between traditional travel and web3 technology. Additionally, engaging with governmental organizations and initiatives, aiming to position travel amidst the evolving landscape of digital payments and identity.</p>

        <p><strong>CAM Token:</strong> Several Centralized Exchanges have shown interest in listing CAM, the native token of Camino. Due to extensive due diligence requirements and broader market conditions, including industry-wide backlogs at exchanges, the listing process is still a work in progress. Further updates will be shared by the Exchanges listing CAM.</p>

        <p>2025 promises to bring more travel into web3 and more web3 into travel, as we continue to lead the industry toward a decentralized, more efficient future.</p>

        <p class="font-medium bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-500 inline-block">Merry Christmas & happy new year from Switzerland!</p>

    </div>

